{"3715410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cavernreach", "steam_appid": 3715410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Note: Portraits are not enabled in the full game release as of right now. After much consideration, I came to the conclusion that they just didn't fit right in the UI or match the style of the game well enough. In a future update, I may enable them again when I feel they match the game better.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cavernreach is a first-person, story-driven cave exploration adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Grant, a contracted caver sent to survey a newly discovered cave system and locate two missing explorers. What begins as a routine expedition quickly spirals into a mystery far greater than anyone anticipated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast underground chambers, navigate flooded passages, and uncover secrets hidden deep beneath the Earth. As you descend deeper into the darkness, you'll discover that some places were never meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/f712c1acfe7b42dca84dfddd31f76636.poster.avif?t=1785876013\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/f712c1acfe7b42dca84dfddd31f76636.webm?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/f712c1acfe7b42dca84dfddd31f76636.mp4?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a vast underground world filled with towering caverns, flooded tunnels, hidden passages, and breathtaking subterranean landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use climbing ropes to descend into the depths, navigate the cave system, and uncover new routes as your expedition pushes further into the unknown. From glowing crystal chambers to immense underground abysses, every new discovery reveals just how much of the cave system remains unexplored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/35bd98d90866bb3c0cc6eeaae6b2abd6.poster.avif?t=1785876013\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/35bd98d90866bb3c0cc6eeaae6b2abd6.webm?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/35bd98d90866bb3c0cc6eeaae6b2abd6.mp4?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything hidden within the cave system can be explained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Grant pushes deeper underground, he encounters strange symbols, impossible discoveries, and evidence that someone, or something, has been here long before his arrival. The trail left behind by the missing cavers leads toward mysteries that challenge everything he thought he knew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you descend, the more apparent it becomes that the greatest danger may not be getting lost in the darkness, but uncovering what has been hidden there all along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/539fe5345d19949c9eea705351a14ce6.poster.avif?t=1785876013\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/539fe5345d19949c9eea705351a14ce6.webm?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/539fe5345d19949c9eea705351a14ce6.mp4?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave was never the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buried beneath miles of rock and hidden from the world lies an impossible discovery, whose existence defies explanation. Strange technology, forgotten structures, and clues left behind by those who came before suggest that something far greater has been hidden beneath the Earth for a very long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Grant pushes forward, the line between exploration and obsession begins to blur. The truth is waiting below, but some discoveries come with consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/950810a533accfc8ab97e9a8bbcfcdea.poster.avif?t=1785876013\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/950810a533accfc8ab97e9a8bbcfcdea.webm?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/950810a533accfc8ab97e9a8bbcfcdea.mp4?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper Grant ventures, the clearer one thing becomes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was never built to hide a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was built to contain one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the truth begins to emerge, Grant finds himself standing at the center of a mystery with consequences that reach far beyond the cave itself. What started as a survey and the search for two missing cavers becomes a desperate attempt to understand a hidden truth before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or is it already too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/0e45114a33adc7b81c53fac611908250.poster.avif?t=1785876013\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/0e45114a33adc7b81c53fac611908250.webm?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/0e45114a33adc7b81c53fac611908250.mp4?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cavernreach is a paced, exploration-driven experience with minimal guidance. There are no objective markers or maps. Progress comes from observation, memory, and curiosity.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Note: Portraits are not enabled in the full game release as of right now. After much consideration, I came to the conclusion that they just didn't fit right in the UI or match the style of the game well enough. In a future update, I may enable them again when I feel they match the game better.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cavernreach is a first-person, story-driven cave exploration adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Grant, a contracted caver sent to survey a newly discovered cave system and locate two missing explorers. What begins as a routine expedition quickly spirals into a mystery far greater than anyone anticipated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast underground chambers, navigate flooded passages, and uncover secrets hidden deep beneath the Earth. As you descend deeper into the darkness, you'll discover that some places were never meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/f712c1acfe7b42dca84dfddd31f76636.poster.avif?t=1785876013\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/f712c1acfe7b42dca84dfddd31f76636.webm?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/f712c1acfe7b42dca84dfddd31f76636.mp4?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a vast underground world filled with towering caverns, flooded tunnels, hidden passages, and breathtaking subterranean landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use climbing ropes to descend into the depths, navigate the cave system, and uncover new routes as your expedition pushes further into the unknown. From glowing crystal chambers to immense underground abysses, every new discovery reveals just how much of the cave system remains unexplored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/35bd98d90866bb3c0cc6eeaae6b2abd6.poster.avif?t=1785876013\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/35bd98d90866bb3c0cc6eeaae6b2abd6.webm?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/35bd98d90866bb3c0cc6eeaae6b2abd6.mp4?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything hidden within the cave system can be explained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Grant pushes deeper underground, he encounters strange symbols, impossible discoveries, and evidence that someone, or something, has been here long before his arrival. The trail left behind by the missing cavers leads toward mysteries that challenge everything he thought he knew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you descend, the more apparent it becomes that the greatest danger may not be getting lost in the darkness, but uncovering what has been hidden there all along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/539fe5345d19949c9eea705351a14ce6.poster.avif?t=1785876013\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/539fe5345d19949c9eea705351a14ce6.webm?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/539fe5345d19949c9eea705351a14ce6.mp4?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave was never the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buried beneath miles of rock and hidden from the world lies an impossible discovery, whose existence defies explanation. Strange technology, forgotten structures, and clues left behind by those who came before suggest that something far greater has been hidden beneath the Earth for a very long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Grant pushes forward, the line between exploration and obsession begins to blur. The truth is waiting below, but some discoveries come with consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/950810a533accfc8ab97e9a8bbcfcdea.poster.avif?t=1785876013\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/950810a533accfc8ab97e9a8bbcfcdea.webm?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/950810a533accfc8ab97e9a8bbcfcdea.mp4?t=1785876013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper Grant ventures, the clearer one thing becomes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was never built to hide a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was built to contain one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the truth begins to emerge, Grant finds himself standing at the center of a mystery with consequences that reach far beyond the cave itself. What started as a survey and the search for two missing cavers becomes a desperate attempt to understand a hidden truth before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or is it already too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/0e45114a33adc7b81c53fac611908250.poster.avif?t=1785876013\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715410/extras/0e45114a33